WEBVTT

00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:18,300
How bad is my chance for lymphetema if I take out two or three more lymph nodes?

00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:24,900
That would make 78 out total in the left armpit trying to decide if I should

00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:32,540
stay on the hormonal suppressing drugs and do no surgery or do the surgery and

00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:38,780
the drugs. Yeah, it's it's really difficult because we've had patients that have

00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:44,940
had the 30 lymph nodes out and seemingly at least all the years we've spoken with

00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:50,540
them seemingly have no issues with lymphetema and then we've had patients that

00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:54,900
have gotten just a few lymph nodes out and can't get rid of the swelling in

00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,020
their arms. I had one patient. Of course she was elderly and she's passed away.

00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:04,580
She was in her late 80s at the time but she was a little spark plug and I think

00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:09,800
she only had one axillary lymph. They'll take it out and my gosh her daughter could

00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:14,500
not get the swelling down in her arm. She had to wear these tight bandages and

00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:20,060
handed bandages or arm up when it was just horrific. So everybody's different on

00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:27,620
how their how their lymph system is able to drain and how much you know a

00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:34,340
demon that they have. You do have to think long term too because I know this

00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:38,820
gal I think it was years before that she came to us that she actually had that

00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:45,220
surgery and as you age you know you might have other comorbidities that are

00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:51,380
causing a demon you know different imbalances and electrolytes and different you know

00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:55,660
issues with your liver and your kidneys and your adrenal glands that you're

00:01:55,660 --> 00:02:03,580
not expelling water correctly and and then that's what it might come back and

00:02:03,580 --> 00:02:08,380
haunt you so that you have you're retaining more water and now it's more

00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:13,660
difficult to get rid of it. So it's a difficult question to answer I wish I

00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:18,420
could say oh if you only get this many out you're gonna be fine. It's just not

00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:23,740
possible to give an honest assessment of that.

